{"change_summary":"No additional source edits were required in this Apply Fixes pass. I verified that the approved provenance work is still present in the current branch: per-parameter `param_meta` support remains wired through the preset loaders and validators, the confidence/range/notes schema and developer-facing formatting helpers remain intact, loader diagnostics still surface range warnings, and the related validation-path regression coverage still passes.","outstanding_risks":["Callers that deserialize presets directly with `toml::from_str` still bypass loader-emitted diagnostics unless they also invoke `validate()` and `check_ranges()` or switch to the `load_*_with_diagnostics()` helpers.","Shipped preset TOML files still do not contain real `[param_meta.*]` entries, so the schema and loader support are in place but actual provenance enrichment remains downstream work.","The worktree still contains an unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory, which was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current provenance-related diff and worktree state to confirm whether any approved fixes were missing from the live branch.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply additional source edits if any approved provenance or validation fixes were absent.","order":1,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Re-ran the focused provenance, preset-loading, scenario-materialization, and validation test targets to confirm the existing fixes remain intact.","order":2,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git diff --stat -- crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs crates/tank_data/data/process/default.toml` returned no output, confirming no additional provenance-file edits were pending.","`git status --short` showed only unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/`.","`cargo test -p tank_data --lib` passed: 28 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib provenance` passed: 11 te